,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.stable (first version with FSR2), 4.5.1.stable, 4.6.dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (2d86b69bf) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.95.05) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nRefraction doesn't work at all when using FSR2 if **Scaling 3D Scale** is lower than `1.0` (*exclusive*):\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42bc561c-9f93-4d88-be36-ef9f4b65e46f\" />\n\nIn contrast, it works with Bilinear or FSR1 scaling modes, even if TAA is enabled:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/943ab33d-1916-478f-b85b-e8bb48692381\" />\n\nThis issue only occurs in Forward+, since FSR2 is only supported there.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Enable Refraction on a BaseMaterial3D, and lower albedo opacity and roughness so you can see its effect.\n- Set **Scaling 3D Mode** to FSR2 and **Scaling 3D Scale** to `0.5` in the Project Settings.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_refraction_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23589947/test_refraction_2.zip)\nPress <kbd>C</kbd> to cycle between scaling 3D modes (default on start is FSR2).","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112885/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112885/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}